<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <me<!doctype html>
ta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fffdf6">
    <meta name="description" content="Find a meaningful way to support clean water, bring your people along, and stay connected with charity: water.">
    <title>Find your way in | charity: water</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --ink: #172b2b;
        --paper: #fffdf6;
        --sun: #ffd21f;
        --water: #087f82;
        --coral: #e8775d;
        --muted: #596765;
        --line: #d9dfd9;
        --display: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
        --body: "DM Sans", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
      }

      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--body);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
      }

      a:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid var(--coral);
        outline-offset: 4px;
      }

      .skip-link {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 5;
        top: 0.75rem;
        left: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
        transform: translateY(-160%);
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .skip-link:focus {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .site-header {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        background: var(--paper);
      }

      .header-inner,
      .section-inner,
      .footer-inner {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 3rem));
        margin-inline: auto;
      }

      .header-inner {
        display: flex;
        min-height: 78px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .wordmark {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        font-size: 1.24rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .wordmark span {
        color: var(--water);
      }

      .main-nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
      }

      .main-nav a {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .main-nav a:hover {
        color: var(--water);
      }

      .main-nav .nav-cta {
        padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
        background: var(--sun);
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .hero {
        display: flex;
        min-height: 590px;
        align-items: center;
        background-color: #244346;
        background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(13 34 36 / 83%) 0%, rgb(13 34 36 / 54%) 55%, rgb(13 34 36 / 20%) 100%), url("charity water.png");
        background-position: center;
        background-size: cover;
        color: white;
      }

      .hero-content {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 3rem));
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding-block: 5rem;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        color: var(--water);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .hero .eyebrow {
        color: var(--sun);
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      p {
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3 {
        font-family: var(--display);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.08;
      }

      h1 {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 4rem;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        max-width: 570px;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 90%);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.8rem;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-flex;
        min-height: 48px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 0.75rem 1.2rem;
        background: var(--sun);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: background-color 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
      }

      .button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        background: #ffe16b;
      }

      .button-secondary {
        border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 72%);
        background: transparent;
        color: white;
      }

      .button-secondary:hover {
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 12%);
      }

      .mission {
        padding-block: 5.5rem;
      }

      .mission-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
        align-items: start;
        gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 7rem);
      }

      .mission h2,
      .ways h2,
      .community h2,
      .story h2,
      .final-cta h2 {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 2.6rem;
      }

      .mission-copy {
        max-width: 620px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
      }

      .mission-copy strong {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .ways {
        padding-block: 5.5rem 6rem;
        background: #eef4ed;
      }

      .section-heading {
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }

      .section-heading h2 {
        max-width: 560px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .section-heading > p {
        max-width: 330px;
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .pathways {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .pathway {
        padding-top: 1.25rem;
        border-top: 3px solid var(--water);
      }

      .pathway:nth-child(2) {
        border-color: var(--coral);
      }

      .pathway:nth-child(3) {
        border-color: #d6a900;
      }

      .pathway h3 {
        margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
        font-size: 1.55rem;
      }

      .pathway p {
        min-height: 5.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .text-link {
        display: inline-block;
        color: var(--water);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        text-underline-offset: 4px;
      }

      .text-link:hover {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .community {
        padding-block: 5.5rem;
        background: var(--water);
        color: white;
      }

      .community .eyebrow {
        color: var(--sun);
      }

      .community-intro {
        max-width: 620px;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 84%);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .steps {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .step {
        padding-top: 1rem;
        border-top: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 52%);
      }

      .step-number {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--sun);
        font-family: var(--display);
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .step h3 {
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        font-size: 1.45rem;
      }

      .step p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 82%);
      }

      .story {
        padding-block: 5rem;
      }

      .story-panel {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.65fr 1.35fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem);
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        background: #fff0e8;
      }

      .story-label {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        color: #994a37;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .story h2 {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .story-placeholder {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
        border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);
        color: #644c44;
        font-family: var(--display);
        font-size: 1.45rem;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      .final-cta {
        padding-block: 4.5rem;
        background: var(--sun);
      }

      .final-cta-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .final-cta h2 {
        max-width: 630px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .button-dark {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: white;
      }

      .button-dark:hover {
        background: #294645;
      }

      .site-footer {
        padding-block: 2rem;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: white;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }

      .footer-inner p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: rgb(255 255 255 / 72%);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      .footer-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }

      .footer-links a {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .header-inner,
        .section-inner,
        .footer-inner {
          width: min(100% - 2rem, 560px);
        }

        .header-inner {
          min-height: 72px;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
          padding-block: 0.75rem;
        }

        .main-nav {
          width: 100%;
          justify-content: space-between;
          gap: 0.6rem;
          padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .main-nav a {
          font-size: 0.78rem;
        }

        .main-nav .nav-cta {
          padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
        }

        .hero {
          min-height: 560px;
          background-position: 58% center;
        }

        .hero-content {
          width: min(100% - 2rem, 560px);
          padding-block: 4.5rem;
        }

        h1 {
          max-width: 580px;
          font-size: 3rem;
        }

        .hero-copy {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .mission,
        .ways,
        .community {
          padding-block: 4rem;
        }

        .mission-grid,
        .story-panel {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 1.25rem;
        }

        .mission h2,
        .ways h2,
        .community h2,
        .story h2,
        .final-cta h2 {
          font-size: 2.15rem;
        }

        .section-heading {
          align-items: start;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 0.9rem;
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .pathways,
        .steps {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 1.75rem;
        }

        .pathway p {
          min-height: 0;
        }

        .step {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr;
          column-gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .step-number {
          grid-row: span 2;
          margin: 0;
        }

        .step h3 {
          margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
        }

        .story {
          padding-block: 3.5rem;
        }

        .story-panel {
          padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .story-placeholder {
          font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .final-cta-inner,
        .footer-inner {
          align-items: start;
          flex-direction: column;
        }

        .final-cta {
          padding-block: 3.5rem;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 380px) {
        .main-nav {
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          justify-content: flex-start;
          column-gap: 1rem;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 2.55rem;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        html {
          scroll-behavior: auto;
        }

        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a class="wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="charity: water home">charity<span>:</span> water</a>
        <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="#mission">Our mission</a>
          <a href="#ways">Get involved</a>
          <a href="#community">Together</a>
          <a class="nav-cta" href="https://www.charitywater.org/donate">Give</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">A little good goes a long way</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Supporting clean water should feel accessible, social, and meaningful.</h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">This is a place to discover an action that fits you, bring others along, and stay connected to the cause.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="button" href="#ways">Find your way in</a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="https://www.charitywater.org/donate">Give clean water</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mission" id="mission" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
        <div class="section-inner mission-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Why clean water</p>
            <h2 id="mission-title">A basic need. A brighter possibility.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="mission-copy">
            <p>Clean water can make room for more: more time for school, more energy for the day, and more choices for the future.</p>
            <p><strong>charity: water works toward a world where everyone has access to clean and safe water.</strong> However you show up, you can be part of moving that work forward.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ways" id="ways" aria-labelledby="ways-title">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Start where you are</p>
              <h2 id="ways-title">There’s more than one way to make a difference.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Choose the step that feels right for you today. You can always find another way in later.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pathways">
            <article class="pathway">
              <h3>Make a gift</h3>
              <p>Support clean water with a one-time donation or ongoing contribution that works for you.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://www.charitywater.org/donate">Explore giving</a>
            </article>
            <article class="pathway">
              <h3>Bring your people</h3>
              <p>Share what matters to you and invite friends, family, or coworkers into the cause.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="#community">Make it a group thing</a>
            </article>
            <article class="pathway">
              <h3>Start on campus</h3>
              <p>Give your student community a reason to gather, take action, and keep the conversation going.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="#community">See how to get started</a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="community" id="community" aria-labelledby="community-title">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">Good is better together</p>
          <h2 id="community-title">Make your next step a shared one.</h2>
          <p class="community-intro">You don’t need a big plan to bring people in. Start small, make it yours, and let your community take it from there.</p>
          <div class="steps">
            <article class="step">
              <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
              <h3>Pick your moment</h3>
              <p>Choose a gathering, a campus event, or a day that already brings your people together.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="step">
              <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
              <h3>Invite someone in</h3>
              <p>Tell them why clean water matters to you, then offer a simple way to join you.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="step">
              <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
              <h3>Keep the connection</h3>
              <p>Share what you learned, celebrate every contribution, and keep making room for others.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="story" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
        <div class="section-inner story-panel">
          <div>
            <span class="story-label">Supporter story · coming soon</span>
            <h2 id="story-title">Real people. Their reasons.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="story-placeholder">A supporter story will live here. This space is ready for a real voice from the charity: water community.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="final-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
        <div class="section-inner final-cta-inner">
          <h2 id="cta-title">Your next step can start right here.</h2>
          <a class="button button-dark" href="https://www.charitywater.org/donate">Take action for clean water</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="footer-inner">
        <p>charity: water · Every action starts somewhere.</p>
        <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer navigation">
          <a href="#mission">Our mission</a>
          <a href="#ways">Get involved</a>
          <a href="https://www.charitywater.org/">charitywater.org</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
